# Build the apps

After every change in this project, rebuild both applications before finishing.

- Web application: `py -3 -m PyInstaller --noconfirm autotyper-web.spec`
- Windows UI, which is the installable app: `py -3 -m PyInstaller --noconfirm autotyper.spec`

The results are `dist\AutoTyper-1.0.0-web.exe` and `dist\AutoTyper-1.0.0-windows.exe`. Stop a running copy of that exe first if the build cannot overwrite it. Do not commit `dist/` or `build/`.
